      "settings": {}, "blocks": {"where-do-you-ship": {"type": "faq", "settings": {"title": "Where do you ship?", "body": "<p>We ship throughout the United States. If your state isn't showing at checkout, email us at <a href='mailto:hello@basenotescent.com'>hello@basenotescent.com</a> and we'll confirm coverage.</p>"}}, "when-will-it-arrive": {"type": "faq", "settings": {"title": "When will my fragrance arrive?", "body": "<p>Most US orders arrive within 4 to 5 business days, and you'll get a tracking email as soon as your order ships.</p><p>Monthly Rotation orders ship each month based on the date of your first order. For example, if you first ordered on September 4, your next orders are processed on October 4, November 4, and so on.</p>"}}, "shipping-cost": {"type": "faq", "settings": {"title": "How much does shipping cost?", "body": "<p><strong>Monthly Rotation:</strong> free US shipping when your subscription is checked out on its own, with no minimum.</p><p><strong>One-time orders:</strong> free standard US shipping on orders of $33 or more. Under $33, standard US shipping is $4.99.</p><p>If a subscription is checked out together with one-time items, standard rates apply to that order, and the recurring shipping charge shown at checkout applies to future renewals. Your exact shipping cost, including any recurring shipping charge, is always shown at checkout before you pay. Full details are in our <a href='/policies/shipping-policy'>Shipping Policy</a>.</p>"}}, "change-address": {"type": "faq", "settings": {"title": "Can I change my shipping address?", "body": "<p>Yes. Update your address in <a href='/account'>My Account</a> before your next scheduled shipment date to take effect for that shipment.</p>"}}, "returns": {"type": "faq", "settings": {"title": "Returns", "body": "<p>All sales are final. Because each fragrance is hand-decanted to order, we don't accept returns or exchanges, opened or unopened. If your order arrives damaged or leaking, or you receive the wrong fragrance, email <a href='mailto:hello@basenotescent.com'>hello@basenotescent.com</a> within 7 days of delivery with your order number and a photo, and we'll make it right with a replacement or a refund. Full details are in our <a href='/policies/refund-policy'>Refund Policy</a>.</p>"}}}, "block_order": ["where-do-you-ship", "when-will-it-arrive", "shipping-cost", "change-address", "returns"]
